<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-RESULT OF MEN'S WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-RESULT OF MEN'S WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results at the men's world handball championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p> Russia    23    Sweden    21  (halftime 11-10)</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p> France    28    Hungary   27  (15-12)</p>
</text>
